DNS resolver and policy (olr-dnsd + unbound)

Usage:
  olr dns [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Add a policy, a blocked name or a local name
  disable     Disable DNS
  enable      Enable DNS
  logs        Show resolver and relay log output
  rm          Remove a policy, a blocked name or a local name
  set         Change DNS settings
  show        Show DNS configuration
  status      Show service state, query counts and drift

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for dns

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr dns [command] --help" for more information about a command.
